      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="560" topLeftY="130" width="340" height="60">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(70, 70, 70, 0.85)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8">
        <p>笛卡尔从"我在怀疑"推出了"存在一个正在怀疑的实体"——一个叫"心灵"的精神实体。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="560" topLeftY="205" width="340" height="30">
